        "id": 195400,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-15T19:53:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"MindWanderer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/48/4816_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MindWanderer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Problem with that is, you then have to rely on your teammates to kill off the target and let you reap the benefit. &nbsp;Chrono-Ranger is usually one of the team's primary damage-dealers, so this frequently forces a different character to take on his role, probably less efficiently.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>A purpose of the variants typically is to shake up their playstyle. &nbsp; Which this does quite well. &nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:22:43.217Z",
