        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-15T19:59:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>CR does enough damage in one shots that even without teammates he can still do okay.  He just needs to wait a round. And besides - once he gets a gun out you can play him identically to his regular version.</p>",
