      {
        "id": 195402,
        "name": "dclietz",
        "username": "dclietz",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/3ec8ea/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-15T20:08:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You give up early game damage, but you get more utility and more late game damage (since it is easier to get all his stuff out). I think it is a fair trade, and actually I'd pick Best of Times against more villains than Base (although I almost always play random heroes). I agree with Powerhound - he shakes up Chrono's playstyle, so I quite enjoy the promo. At least try the combo once!&nbsp;</p>",
